Schema Design:

1. Users Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   username: String,
   email: String,
   password: String,
   bio: String,
   role: String,
   createdAt: Date
   }

2. Posts Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   title: String,
   content: String,
   author: ObjectId,
   categoryId: ObjectId,
   tags: [String],
   likes: Number,
   views: Number,
   createdAt: Date,
   updatedAt: Date
   }

3. Comments Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   postId: ObjectId,
   userId: ObjectId,
   comment: String,
   parentCommentId: ObjectId,
   createdAt: Date
   }

4. Categories Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   name: String
   }

5. Likes Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   postId: ObjectId,
   userId: ObjectId
   }

6. Bookmarks Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   userId: ObjectId,
   postId: ObjectId,
   savedAt: Date
   }

7. Views Collection:
   {
   _id: ObjectId,
   postId: ObjectId,
   userId: ObjectId,
   viewedAt: Date
   }


